SPDX-License-Identifier: CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0

Modified by the EasyScanner contributors, 2026: the tripod-nut plate is cut
off the upper part and its jaw rebuilt, and the lower part gets a snap-on
channel for a 16 x 13 mm aluminium profile; see README.md in this directory.

The lower part also uses the profile snap-on channel from ../models/profile_clip.py
(CERN-OHL-S-2.0); as part of this remix it is additionally licensed under
CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 by the same copyright holders.

The original model is itself a remix of "Printable phone holder for modular
mounting system" by Gavitka (https://www.thingiverse.com/thing:3500945),
based on the Modular Mounting System (https://www.thingiverse.com/thing:2194278).

The material is provided as-is, without warranties of any kind; see section 5
of the licence.
